    section: "A", questionRef: "2022 HL Section A Q2(a)",
    questionText: "Using the data above, explain whether the Balance of Payments is likely to have an overall expansionary or contractionary effect. Refer to relevant figures in the diagram above to explain your answer. Indicate by means of a tick (✓) whether it is expansionary or contractionary.",
