    questionText: "Firms in Perfect Competition are said to be Price-Takers. On the diagrams below label and illustrate what happens to the market equilibrium as more firms enter the market. Explain each of your diagrams below.",
    tariffModel: {"kind":"fixed","notation":"fixed","answer":null,"ofParts":null,"perPart":null}, totalMarks: 4,
