    section: "B", questionRef: "2025 HL Q15(b)(iii) — agree",
    questionText: "In Budget 2025, the government decided it was extending mortgage interest relief for taxpayers who are paying more in mortgage interest in 2024 than they were in 2022. Do you AGREE with this decision? Explain your answer.",
